{{slim-wikipedia|Xerxes|Xerxes (disambiguation)}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|sc=polytonic|Ξέρξης|tr=Xerxēs|lang=grc}}, from {{etyl|peo|en}} {{term|𐎧𐏁𐎹𐎠𐎼𐏁𐎠||ruler among kings|tr=Xšayāršā|lang=peo}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|/ˈzɜk.siːz/}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|zûrk'sēz}}, {{IPA|/ˈzɝksiːz/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# [[w:Xerxes_I_of_Persia|Xerxes I]], a Persian king of the Achaemenid dynasty who reigned 485-465 BC.
# [[w:Xerxes_II_of_Persia|Xerxes II]], a Persian king who ruled for 45 days in 424 BC before being assassinated.
# {{non-gloss definition|{{given name|male|from=Persian}} mainly applied to historical and fictional characters.}}

